<title>UK: Loftus Road kicks off with 4.4 mln stg loss.</title>
<headline>Loftus Road kicks off with 4.4 mln stg loss.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>May 13 to November 30 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		16.2 loss	    n/a</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 nil		    nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     4.4 loss	     n/a</p>
<p> Turnover		   3.10		   n/a</p>
<p>Full company name - Loftus Road Plc. The firm is the holding company for Queens Park Rangers Football Club and Wasps Rugby Football Club, which floated on the Alternative Investment Market in October 1996. The company said in its flotation prospectus it did not plan to pay a dividend in the year to May 31 1997.</p>
